sibilidade</dt><dd class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark text-right\">Parcialmente acessível</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-gray-200/70 py-2.5 last:border-b-0\"><dt class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0 text-sm text-tuggi-slate\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sun w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-slate/70 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M12 20v2\"></path><path d=\"m4.93 4.93 1.41 1.41\"></path><path d=\"m17.66 17.66 1.41 1.41\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 12h2\"></path><path d=\"m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41\"></path><path d=\"m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41\"></path></svg>Melhor horário</dt><dd class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark text-right\">Manhã · Tarde</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-gray-200/70 py-2.5 last:border-b-0\"><dt class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0 text-sm text-tuggi-slate\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-slate/70 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg>Idiomas</dt><dd class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-tuggi-dark text-right\">English · Español · Português · Italiano</dd></div></dl><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3\"><a href=\"/d/tuggi\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-4 bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark font-black rounded-2xl shadow-lg shadow-tuggi-primary/20 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-headphones w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 14h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-7a9 9 0 0 1 18 0v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-1a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3\"></path></svg>Ouvir no app Tuggi</a><a href=\"#route-map\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 bg-white text-tuggi-dark font-bold rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-5 h-5 text-tuggi-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Ver o mapa</a></div></div></div><p class=\"order-2 lg:order-1 text-lg text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\">Uma viagem ao sul histórico dos Estados Unidos, a menos de 30 minutos de Atlanta. A rota passa pela praça charmosa de Marietta e seu museu de &quot;…E o Vento Levou&quot;, sobe o Kennesaw Mountain, palco de uma batalha importante da Guerra Civil, e chega ao museu da Grande Perseguição da Locomotiva, o roubo de trem que virou lenda e inspirou filmes.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"route-map\" class=\"py-16 bg-white\" aria-labelledby=\"itinerary-heading\"><div class=\"page-shell\"><h2 id=\"itinerary-heading\" class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-tuggi-dark mb-3\">O que você vai ver e ouvir</h2><p class=\"text-tuggi-slate\">As paradas deste roteiro, em ordem — com prévias de áudio quando disponíveis.</p><div class=\"mt-10 grid gap-10 lg:g