dio em 12 paradas, cobrindo aproximadamente 86,4 km. No seu ritmo — o áudio toca automaticamente enquanto você se desloca.</p></details><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-5\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-bold text-tuggi-dark\">Este roteiro é acessível?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Esta rota é classificada como: Parcialmente acessível. Confira cada parada para detalhes específicos de acesso.</p></details><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-5\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-bold text-tuggi-dark\">Em quais idiomas está disponível?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Este roteiro está disponível em: English, Español, Português, Italiano.</p></details><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-5\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-bold text-tuggi-dark\">Preciso de conexão com a internet?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Não. Baixe o roteiro no app Tuggi e ouça offline — o áudio é ativado pela sua localização, sem precisar usar as mãos.</p></details><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-5\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-bold text-tuggi-dark\">Dá para fazer a pé ou de carro?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Esta rota foi pensada para um trajeto Fácil. O áudio se adapta ao seu ritmo.</p></details></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 bg-white border-t border-gray-100\" aria-labelledby=\"related-heading\"><div class=\"page-shell\"><h2 id=\"related-heading\" class=\"text-3xl font-black text-tuggi-dark mb-8\">Mais roteiros por perto</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><a class=\"group flex flex-col h-full overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 bg-white shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tuggi-primary-text focus-visible:ring-offset-2\" href=\"/pt/tours/united-states/atlanta-classica\"><div class=\"bg-tuggi-bg border-b border-gray-100\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 62\" class=\"w-full h-auto\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M45 49.9L45 50.4L45.6 50.5L45.6 49.2L43.7 49.3L43.2 48L41.6 48.4L41.6 47.9L42.2 48L42.5 49.5L42.4 48.6L41 48